1
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:04,501
<i>Run, until we reach</i>

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:08,501
<i>Until we reach you</i>

3
00:00:14,083 --> 00:00:16,876
<i>The clear blue open sea</i>

4
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:20,042
<i>A sliver of a miracle</i>

5
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:26,918
<i>We've encountered more
Than we could ever imagine</i>

6
00:00:27,292 --> 00:00:30,166
<i>We've encountered more
Than we could ever imagine</i>

7
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:33,751
<i>The goal is still out of sight</i>

8
00:00:33,918 --> 00:00:37,334
<i>The goal is still out of sight</i>

9
00:00:37,501 --> 00:00:40,583
<i>Just to see your smile</i>

10
00:00:40,584 --> 00:00:44,542
<i>If we wavered,
We couldn't shine</i>

11
00:00:44,918 --> 00:00:47,918
<i>We even strove to conquer
Our weaknesses</i>

12
00:00:48,501 --> 00:00:53,834
<i>We, who were truly devoted</i>

13
00:00:54,083 --> 00:00:57,792
<i>Have always been the same</i>

14
00:00:58,334 --> 00:00:59,918
<i>Run</i>

15
00:01:00,042 --> 00:01:05,918
<i>Until we reach
Until we reach you, hey</i>

16
00:01:06,709 --> 00:01:10,375
<i>Less than legendary?</i>

17
00:01:10,584 --> 00:01:13,375
<i>No problem! It's all good!</i>

18
00:01:13,542 --> 00:01:15,834
<i>Until the day we can laugh</i>

19
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,751
<i>Follow the shining map</i>

20
00:01:20,876 --> 00:01:25,542
<i>So, no more hesitation, fighter
It's gonna be alright</i>

21
00:01:40,042 --> 00:01:42,876
[panting]

22
00:01:49,834 --> 00:01:51,417
[roars]

23
00:01:52,667 --> 00:01:55,834
[panting]

24
00:01:58,042 --> 00:02:01,792
[dramatic fanfare]

25
00:02:02,042 --> 00:02:03,959
This Black Kingdom
has been pretty fun,

26
00:02:04,083 --> 00:02:05,792
but we're out of here.

27
00:02:06,125 --> 00:02:08,959
Please let it be Elbaph
out there for me.

28
00:02:09,626 --> 00:02:11,459
[yelling]

29
00:02:11,751 --> 00:02:15,375
Gum-Gum...

30
00:02:15,501 --> 00:02:19,125
Kong Gun!

31
00:02:19,876 --> 00:02:22,709
[dramatic music]

32
00:02:25,876 --> 00:02:28,250
An encounter on a Snowfield

33
00:02:28,417 --> 00:02:30,417
Loki, the Accursed Prince.

34
00:02:36,501 --> 00:02:39,125
[groans] Where are you?

35
00:02:39,292 --> 00:02:41,125
Sunny, come back!

36
00:02:41,334 --> 00:02:43,751
[whimpers]

37
00:02:43,918 --> 00:02:45,459
Hey, Straw Hat!

38
00:02:45,584 --> 00:02:46,875
Straw Hat!

39
00:02:46,876 --> 00:02:49,250
Straw Hat, you there?

40
00:02:49,375 --> 00:02:50,834
Where are you?

41
00:02:51,667 --> 00:02:52,792
Straw Hat?

42
00:02:53,626 --> 00:02:54,959
Straw Hat?

43
00:02:55,542 --> 00:02:56,625
Anything?

44
00:02:56,626 --> 00:02:59,041
We looked everywhere,
but there's no sign of him.

45
00:02:59,042 --> 00:03:00,501
He is gone!

46
00:03:00,626 --> 00:03:02,542
We searched
all the nearby waters too,

47
00:03:02,667 --> 00:03:03,834
but no luck!

48
00:03:04,125 --> 00:03:06,124
If that's the case,
there's a chance

49
00:03:06,125 --> 00:03:08,083
they may have sunk into the sea.

50
00:03:08,209 --> 00:03:10,333
[ALL shocked]

51
00:03:10,334 --> 00:03:12,501
[groans] I'm not giving up!

52
00:03:12,626 --> 00:03:14,667
Time to search the sea floor!

53
00:03:14,876 --> 00:03:18,292
Giant pirate crew,
get ready to die!

54
00:03:18,626 --> 00:03:19,709
All right!

55
00:03:19,834 --> 00:03:20,958
Yeah!

56
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:23,626
We're coming, Straw Hats!
Don't you worry!

57
00:03:23,876 --> 00:03:26,375
Let's go!

58
00:03:28,375 --> 00:03:29,375
Huh?

59
00:03:29,792 --> 00:03:31,417
Warriors of Elbaph,

60
00:03:31,542 --> 00:03:33,542
may I have
your attention, please?

61
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:38,501
[heavy footsteps]

62
00:03:38,876 --> 00:03:40,959
Did you find something, Franky?

63
00:03:41,584 --> 00:03:42,417
We're done here.

64
00:03:42,834 --> 00:03:44,083
Surge is off!

65
00:03:44,626 --> 00:03:46,167
What?

66
00:03:46,292 --> 00:03:49,083
[ALL] What?

67
00:03:51,250 --> 00:03:53,918
[wind blowing]

68
00:03:57,083 --> 00:03:59,667
[indistinct chatter]

69
00:04:00,501 --> 00:04:02,000
But why give up now?

70
00:04:02,209 --> 00:04:04,292
Your friends are
still missing, right?

71
00:04:04,792 --> 00:04:07,583
Yeah, the thing is,
we searched everywhere we could

72
00:04:07,584 --> 00:04:09,000
and still came up empty.

73
00:04:09,459 --> 00:04:11,959
But I'm sure they're okay
wherever they are.

74
00:04:12,125 --> 00:04:14,833
And I'm not super worried
about Sunny either.

75
00:04:14,834 --> 00:04:16,417
She's too damn tough to sink.

76
00:04:16,626 --> 00:04:17,584
[groans]

77
00:04:17,751 --> 00:04:18,709
You think so?

78
00:04:18,834 --> 00:04:20,209
Aren't you worried?

79
00:04:20,375 --> 00:04:21,209
Nope.

80
00:04:22,083 --> 00:04:23,584
They're still alive.

81
00:04:24,209 --> 00:04:26,459
My bros won't die that easy.

82
00:04:27,209 --> 00:04:28,459
I agree.

83
00:04:28,626 --> 00:04:30,458
It's not like
this is the first time

84
00:04:30,459 --> 00:04:31,918
our crew has gotten separated.

85
00:04:32,876 --> 00:04:34,334
- [chuckles]
- Hmm.

86
00:04:35,083 --> 00:04:36,959
Don't worry, they're fine.

87
00:04:37,542 --> 00:04:38,918
If you guys say so,

88
00:04:39,042 --> 00:04:40,751
I get where
you're coming from now.

89
00:04:41,292 --> 00:04:42,626
Bosses, you agree?

90
00:04:42,918 --> 00:04:44,584
[gargling laughter]

91
00:04:44,709 --> 00:04:46,833
I suppose
we were worried for nothing.

92
00:04:46,834 --> 00:04:49,250
I've just finished tapping
into my shark network.

93
00:04:50,209 --> 00:04:52,416
Wherever Luffy
and the others are right now,

94
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:54,583
they don't seem to be
anywhere in the sea.

95
00:04:54,584 --> 00:04:55,791
Which makes me wonder

96
00:04:55,792 --> 00:04:57,708
if the six of them
may have washed up

97
00:04:57,709 --> 00:04:58,959
on an island somewhere.

98
00:04:59,375 --> 00:05:02,125
Don't worry, my friends.
You've helped us enough already.

99
00:15:05,209 --> 00:15:07,667
Now that you mention it,
I do see something there.

100
00:15:08,250 --> 00:15:09,708
Was that always there?

101
00:15:09,709 --> 00:15:10,917
He moves around so much,

102
00:15:10,918 --> 00:15:12,834
I don't know if I ever got
a good look.

103
00:15:13,167 --> 00:15:14,584
It seems unnatural to me.

104
00:15:15,709 --> 00:15:16,876
His arm is blurry,

105
00:15:17,459 --> 00:15:18,959
but the mark is oddly sharp.

106
00:15:19,459 --> 00:15:21,375
It's weird how that part's
so in focus.

107
00:15:21,834 --> 00:15:23,375
It seems familiar somehow.

108
00:15:23,709 --> 00:15:25,167
[gargling laughter]

109
00:15:25,584 --> 00:15:27,417
Straw Hat sure is moving up!

110
00:15:27,542 --> 00:15:30,541
An emperor with a mighty bounty
just like Red Hair!

111
00:15:30,542 --> 00:15:33,124
I heard that one of
the young warriors from Elbaph

112
00:15:33,125 --> 00:15:35,292
recently pledged
his loyalty to him.

113
00:15:35,584 --> 00:15:36,584
Hajrudin.

114
00:15:36,709 --> 00:15:38,292
Technically,
he's the king's son.

115
00:15:38,792 --> 00:15:40,459
You mean he's Elbaph royalty?

116
00:15:40,584 --> 00:15:41,708
We didn't know!

117
00:15:41,709 --> 00:15:43,333
He used to be a little savage,

118
00:15:43,334 --> 00:15:44,918
but you didn't
hear that from me.

119
00:15:51,626 --> 00:15:53,875
He wanted to come
and pick you up at Egghead,

120
00:15:53,876 --> 00:15:55,292
but it didn't quite work out.

121
00:16:02,167 --> 00:16:04,959
He got held up
by a bit of trouble in Elbaph.

122
00:16:05,209 --> 00:16:07,751
That's why you only got us vets!

123
00:16:08,334 --> 00:16:09,501
Trouble, you say?

124
00:16:09,792 --> 00:16:11,709
That's the first
I heard of this!

125
00:16:11,959 --> 00:16:12,792
[groans]

126
00:16:14,417 --> 00:16:15,250
Oh.

127
00:16:15,709 --> 00:16:17,999
I'm afraid
this little development happened

128
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,751
while the bosses were away.

129
00:16:24,459 --> 00:16:26,918
The King of Elbaph had
another child.

130
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,834
This time, a legitimate one.

131
00:16:32,667 --> 00:16:34,292
[LUFFY laughs]

132
00:16:48,876 --> 00:16:50,292
It's so cold!

133
00:16:50,918 --> 00:16:53,584
[grunts]

134
00:16:54,667 --> 00:16:55,792
[sighs]

135
00:16:56,667 --> 00:16:59,375
Whoa, look at these trees!

136
00:17:05,626 --> 00:17:06,833
Toy blocks were fun,

137
00:17:06,834 --> 00:17:09,375
but this is
how a real adventure should be.

138
00:17:10,083 --> 00:17:12,958
Whoever was roaring like that
sure had a big voice.

139
00:17:12,959 --> 00:17:14,459
Must be huge.

140
00:17:15,125 --> 00:17:18,626
Maybe he knows where I can find
some more of that big food.

141
00:17:20,334 --> 00:17:23,584
[low growling]

142
00:17:23,751 --> 00:17:25,083
Hey!

143
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,876
Where are you?

144
00:17:28,876 --> 00:17:30,918
[growling]

145
00:17:33,209 --> 00:17:35,459
Okay, what's your deal?

146
00:17:35,834 --> 00:17:38,459
[growling]

147
00:17:47,083 --> 00:17:50,083
[growling]

148
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:55,751
[roaring]

149
00:18:03,542 --> 00:18:06,042
Sounds like you're... that way.

150
00:18:07,417 --> 00:18:09,626
[dramatic music playing]

151
00:18:10,083 --> 00:18:11,834
It's a tragic tale.

152
00:18:12,417 --> 00:18:16,125
The second son of the king
is known as the Accursed Prince.

153
00:18:16,709 --> 00:18:17,667
Accursed?

154
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,333
He committed
every evil deed in the book,

155
00:18:20,334 --> 00:18:21,500
so they chained him up,

156
00:18:21,501 --> 00:18:23,792
and that's how he's been
for several years now.

157
00:18:24,083 --> 00:18:25,875
He nearly fought
his way free once,

158
00:18:25,876 --> 00:18:28,333
and it took
an entire troop of warriors

159
00:18:28,334 --> 00:18:30,042
to get him under control again.

160
00:18:30,334 --> 00:18:31,292
Hmm.

161
00:18:31,459 --> 00:18:33,667
Dude fought a whole troop
of giants alone?

162
00:18:33,792 --> 00:18:35,834
He's got to be
one hell of a monster!

163
00:18:36,209 --> 00:18:37,208
He is.

164
00:18:37,209 --> 00:18:40,042
Strong, vicious,
and out of his mind.

165
00:18:40,292 --> 00:18:43,292
[dramatic music]

166
00:18:49,876 --> 00:18:52,958
He was driven by a lust
for the legendary Devil Fruit

167
00:18:52,959 --> 00:18:55,584
passed down
through the Elbaph royal family.

168
00:18:56,125 --> 00:18:59,709
In the end, he murdered
his own father, King Harald,

169
00:18:59,918 --> 00:19:02,042
and took the fruit's power
for himself.

170
00:19:04,876 --> 00:19:07,501
Yes, I've heard
tale of this prince.

171
00:19:08,083 --> 00:19:11,125
[dramatic music]

172
00:19:11,834 --> 00:19:13,500
All the giants fear

173
00:19:13,501 --> 00:19:15,834
that he may be
free again someday.

174
00:19:17,542 --> 00:19:20,374
He would surely tear
this country apart,

175
00:19:20,375 --> 00:19:22,334
not the whole world.

176
00:19:24,459 --> 00:19:26,959
He is the shame of Elbaph!

177
00:19:30,626 --> 00:19:32,751
The accursed prince!

178
00:19:34,918 --> 00:19:36,292
Loki!

179
00:19:36,667 --> 00:19:39,667
[dramatic music]

180
00:19:51,042 --> 00:19:53,042
Name yourself.

181
00:19:54,918 --> 00:19:57,000
[chuckles] I'm Luffy.

182
00:19:58,083 --> 00:20:00,292
And I'm going to be
King of the Pirates.

183
00:20:02,834 --> 00:20:05,042
[chuckling]

184
00:20:05,334 --> 00:20:06,167
The king?

185
00:20:06,709 --> 00:20:08,334
Yep. So where am I?

186
00:20:08,501 --> 00:20:09,584
And who are you?

187
00:20:09,709 --> 00:20:10,750
What?

188
00:20:10,751 --> 00:20:12,626
You came here by chance?

189
00:20:12,876 --> 00:20:13,751
[LUFFY] Kind of.

190
00:20:16,501 --> 00:20:19,541
Well, I suppose
if you did know where you were,

191
00:20:19,542 --> 00:20:21,334
you wouldn't have come to me.

192
00:20:21,834 --> 00:20:23,918
Very well, I'll tell you.

193
00:20:25,542 --> 00:20:28,542
[dramatic music]

194
00:20:29,292 --> 00:20:32,876
Welcome to the kingdom
of Elbaph's warriors.

195
00:20:34,209 --> 00:20:36,083
The Warland!

196
00:20:36,626 --> 00:20:39,125
[epic music swells]

197
00:20:44,375 --> 00:20:46,833
A nation that once
devoted itself

198
00:20:46,834 --> 00:20:48,584
to endless conflict.

199
00:20:49,459 --> 00:20:54,042
The strongest kingdom
in the world!

200
00:21:04,209 --> 00:21:06,249
And I am the one

201
00:21:06,250 --> 00:21:08,501
who will bring
this world to an end.

202
00:21:11,209 --> 00:21:13,375
I am the Sun God.

203
00:21:14,751 --> 00:21:15,918
Loki.

204
00:21:23,667 --> 00:21:26,667
<i>Here I am straining
Both my eyes</i>

205
00:21:29,167 --> 00:21:32,334
<i>And checking
Where I am standing right now</i>

206
00:21:34,501 --> 00:21:38,709
<i>With my brain consumed
By all the delusion and despair</i>

207
00:21:38,834 --> 00:21:41,792
<i>I'm always bound
To be a little off somehow</i>

208
00:21:42,542 --> 00:21:46,083
<i>The things that come up vividly</i>

209
00:21:47,959 --> 00:21:51,334
<i>Are always the cruel memories</i>

210
00:21:53,334 --> 00:21:55,500
<i>I gather up the scraps</i>

211
00:21:55,501 --> 00:21:57,751
<i>Of the simple boredom
Of my life</i>

212
00:21:57,876 --> 00:22:01,459
<i>I might turn
Into somebody else but me</i>

213
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:06,124
<i>I wonder which future
Would fit someone like me now</i>

214
00:22:06,125 --> 00:22:09,082
<i>From here on no matter how hard
I try to strain my eyes</i>

215
00:22:09,083 --> 00:22:12,334
<i>I'll still see nothing anyhow</i>

216
00:22:12,459 --> 00:22:15,834
<i>I'm riding the headwind</i>

217
00:22:15,959 --> 00:22:18,875
<i>I pour it into the tear
Of destiny</i>

218
00:22:18,876 --> 00:22:22,959
<i>As I split
All the false fantasies apart</i>

219
00:22:23,083 --> 00:22:26,584
<i>And everyone's</i>

220
00:22:26,751 --> 00:22:29,500
<i>Piling up
Their own life-or-death reality</i>

221
00:22:29,501 --> 00:22:31,374
<i>All the time just like that</i>

222
00:22:31,375 --> 00:22:33,958
<i>Then tomorrow comes
Way too loud</i>

223
00:22:33,959 --> 00:22:37,959
<i>Leaving no time
Even just to pray</i>

224
00:22:38,709 --> 00:22:42,792
<i>And that future we see</i>

225
00:22:43,292 --> 00:22:46,626
<i>It all belongs to me</i>

226
00:22:55,042 --> 00:22:57,999
<i>Luffy encounters Loki,
the Accursed Prince,</i>

227
00:22:58,000 --> 00:23:00,374
<i>perpetrator of a crime
that rocked Elbaph.</i>

228
00:23:00,375 --> 00:23:02,999
<i>Although he has been imprisoned
in the snow for years,</i>

229
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:05,750
<i>Loki claims to have information
about Red-Haired Shanks</i>

230
00:23:05,751 --> 00:23:07,041
<i>and offers Luffy a deal</i>

231
00:23:07,042 --> 00:23:09,459
<i>that he may not have
the luxury of declining.</i>

232
00:23:10,292 --> 00:23:12,000
On the next One Piece.

233
00:23:12,125 --> 00:23:13,708
A dangerous deal!

234
00:23:13,709 --> 00:23:16,125
Loki of the Underworld
and Luffy.

235
00:23:16,501 --> 00:23:18,918
I'm going to be
King of the Pirates!

